vsqlite++
------------------------------------------
Welldesigned and portable SQLite3 Wrapper for C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  libsqlite3_0-3.49.1-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libvsqlitepp-devel-0.4.2-1bl1
  libvsqlitepp0-0.4.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/vinzenz/vsqlite--

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/vinzenz/vsqlite--/archive/refs/tags/v0.4.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack vsqlite++-0.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./vsqlite++-0.4.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/vsqlite++-0.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vsqlite++-0.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvsqlitepp0-0.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvsqlitepp-devel-0.4.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

